# Byte-cache and local test scaffolding. Mirrors `packages/platools-py/.gitignore`
# — the only other Python package in this workspace — rather than widening the
# root ignore file, because these paths are a property of running an interpreter
# in THIS directory and nowhere else in the repository.
#
# WIN-270 (M4.4) added this: `packages/platos-client-py/tests/test_v1_contract.py`
# is executed by `pnpm test:sdk-v1`, so a `__pycache__` now appears the moment the
# V1 evidence step runs, and an untracked-but-unignored directory would make
# `scripts/v1-ledger.test.mjs` — which reads `git ls-files --cached --others` —
# count files nobody committed.
.venv/
.venv_*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Build artefacts (mirrors root `dist`/`packages/**/dist`, but the build backend
# writes here at the package root, not nested in src).
build/
*.egg-info/
